  "about": "On-device check for live video (the explicit-content blocker): the runtime and the models. Every file is pinned by SHA-256; the page fetches it from the GifOS model host at <base>/<key>, checks every byte and hands the bytes to the check's worker, which makes no request of its own. src names the published file the copy was taken from. chain: every sampled frame goes to the first model; a frame goes on only while each model finds it at or over its line, and counts as explicit only when the last one does (lazy: loaded when a frame first reaches it). deep: a larger model a desktop adds when it can run it (needs), at most one frame every few seconds. Score = the sum of the pos classes of the softmax.",
